"johann-wolfgang-von-goethe": {"n":"Johann Wolfgang von Goethe","a":["goethe"],"c":["A German poet, novelist and statesman","Lived 1749–1832; born in Frankfurt, lived in Weimar","Faust, who sells his soul to the devil","The Sorrows of Young Werther","Germany's cultural institute abroad is named after him"],"p":"Johann Wolfgang von Goethe"},
